---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Documentation — RouteNex Quickstart Guide">
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
      <aside class="hidden lg:block lg:col-span-3">
        <nav class="sticky top-24 space-y-6 text-sm" aria-label="Documentation navigation">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">Getting Started</h3>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-body">
              <li><a href="#quickstart" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 text-ink font-medium bg-hairline/60">1. Instant CLI (1-Command)</a></li>
              <li><a href="#free-tier" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">2. Free Tier Pools</a></li>
              <li><a href="#combos" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">3. Provider Combos</a></li>
              <li><a href="#coding-agents" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">4. Coding Agent Setup</a></li>
              <li><a href="#configuration" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">5. BYOK Configuration</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">Core Concepts</h3>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-body">
              <li><a href="#routing-modes" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">Routing Strategies</a></li>
              <li><a href="#failover" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 hover:text-ink hover:bg-hairline/40">Circuit Breakers</a></li>
              <li><a href="/dashboard" class="block rounded px-2 py-1 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Observability Dashboard →</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <!-- Main Doc Content -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-9 max-w-3xl">
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-canvas px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-mute border border-hairline">Docs / Quick Start</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-mute">• 3 min read</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono">
            MIT Licensed
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink sm:text-5xl">
          RouteNex Quickstart
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-body leading-relaxed">
          RouteNex is a high-performance, open-source AI routing gateway. It operates as a drop-in proxy adhering to the standard OpenAI API specification, providing free-tier token aggregation, deterministic failover clusters, and full request observability.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-8 border-hairline" />

        <!-- 1. Instant CLI -->
        <section id="quickstart" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">1. Instant CLI (Zero-Install)</h2>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5">Recommended</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            Run the gateway instantly on your machine with one command. It spins up on port 3001 with default free-tier pools and local virtual keys already enabled:
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-[#171717] p-4 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-neutral-800 mb-3 text-neutral-400">
              <span>Terminal</span>
            </div>
            <code>npx routenex</code>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated p-4 text-xs font-mono text-body space-y-1">
            <div class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">✔ RouteNex Gateway ready at http://localhost:3001/v1</div>
            <div>• Free Tier Models: <span class="text-ink">pollinations/openai, pollinations/qwen, cerebras/llama-3.3-70b</span></div>
            <div>• Virtual Key: <span class="text-ink">rn-local-dev-default</span> (or unauthenticated on localhost)</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Free Tier Pools -->
        <section id="free-tier" class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">2. Zero-Cost Free Tier Pools</h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            RouteNex aggregates native free developer allowances from top AI infrastructure providers, giving developers hundreds of millions of free tokens per month without paying a cent:
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">🎁 Pollinations AI</span>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">100% free, zero-key required. Unlimited anonymous access to OpenAI, Qwen, and Mistral models.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">⚡ Cerebras Cloud</span>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">World-record 2,000 tokens/sec Llama 3.3 70B inference with 1,000,000 free tokens daily.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">⚡ Groq Cloud</span>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">Ultra-low latency Llama 3.3 70B with 14,400 free requests per day.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">🧠 DeepSeek & Gemini</span>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">DeepSeek V3 / R1 reasoning and Google AI Studio generous free developer tier.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Provider Combos -->
        <section id="combos" class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">3. Provider Combos & Failover Clusters</h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            Combos group multiple models into an ordered failover sequence. If your primary provider gets rate-limited (HTTP 429) or experiences downtime, RouteNex automatically passes the prompt to the next target:
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-[#171717] p-4 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-neutral-800 mb-3 text-neutral-400">
              <span>cURL (Calling a Combo)</span>
            </div>
            <pre><code>curl http://localhost:3001/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '&#123;
    "model": "combo/free-unlimited",
    "messages": [
      &#123;"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python script to sort a list by frequency."&#125;
    ]
  &#125;'</code></pre>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-mute">
            <strong>Default Built-in Combos:</strong> <code class="text-ink font-mono">combo/free-unlimited</code> (Groq ➔ Cerebras ➔ Pollinations) and <code class="text-ink font-mono">combo/coding-power</code> (DeepSeek ➔ Groq ➔ GPT-4o-mini).
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Coding Agent Setup -->
        <section id="coding-agents" class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">4. Coding Agent Setup (Cursor, Claude Code, Cline)</h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            RouteNex is built specifically for autonomous developer agents. Connect any agent in 30 seconds:
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <!-- Cursor -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated space-y-2">
              <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-ink">Cursor IDE</span>
              <p class="text-xs text-mute">Cursor Settings ➔ Models ➔ OpenAI API Key ➔ Override Base URL:</p>
              <div class="p-2 rounded bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-200 font-mono text-xs">
                http://localhost:3001/v1
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Claude Code -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated space-y-2">
              <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-ink">Claude Code CLI</span>
              <div class="p-2 rounded bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-200 font-mono text-xs">
                export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:3001/v1"<br />
                claude --model combo/coding-power
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Cline -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-elevated space-y-2">
              <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-ink">Cline (VS Code Extension)</span>
              <p class="text-xs text-mute">Select provider <strong>OpenAI Compatible</strong>, set Base URL to <code class="text-ink font-mono">http://localhost:3001/v1</code> and model to <code class="text-ink font-mono">combo/free-unlimited</code>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Configuration -->
        <section id="configuration" class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">5. BYOK Environment Variables</h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            You can configure your provider keys directly via the in-browser <a href="/dashboard" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">Dashboard</a> or via a local <code class="font-mono text-ink">.env</code> file:
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-[#171717] p-4 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-neutral-800 mb-3 text-neutral-400">
              <span>.env</span>
            </div>
            <pre><code>ROUTENEX_PORT=3001
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=csk-...
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA footer -->
        <div class="mt-16 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Open the RouteNex Dashboard</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute mt-1">Configure credentials, create Combos, and inspect live request telemetry.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/dashboard"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:opacity-90 transition"
          >
            Open Dashboard →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
